    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210">

                <pb facs="0380" n="365" sameAs="frus:frus1949v04/pg365"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.20/12–2949: Circular telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Certain Diplomatic Offices
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d210-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-29T08:00:00-05:00">December 29,
                            1949—8 a. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    NAT Council will meet Jan 6 consider
                    recommendations Dec 1 Paris mtg of Defense Comite.</p>
                <pb facs="0381" n="366" xml:id="pg366"/>
                <p>Secy will chair mtg with Washington Ambs representing other member countries.</p>
                <p>Most important item on Agenda is Strategic concept for Defense of North Atlantic
                    area which shld be approved since individual member govts have already agreed to
                    it. (Approval of concept by Council is necessary before President can consider
                    it in connection with release of nine hundred million MDAP appropriation.)</p>
                <p>[Here follow comments on five other items on the agenda of the January 6 meeting
                    of the NAT Council.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d210-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d210-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the Embassies at London, Paris, Rome, Brussels (repeated to Luxembourg),
                    The Hague, Copenhagen, Oslo, Lisbon, Ottawa, and to the Legation at
                    Reykjavik.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
